/Title (Our experiments demonstrate that federated traffic-flow prediction can maintain useful prediction accuracy while reducing model-update communication. Using FP16 reduces the measured communication cost from 79.52 KB/round to 39.76 KB/round, approximately a 50% reduction, while the measured prediction errors remain comparable.)
